ll,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-d4aa3e64bf7f3a7a475f"]},"ordering_evidence":"gongsuntao-q-d4aa3e64bf7f3a7a475f","source_order":[8,314,184],"order":2099},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o014b","title":"曹操还邺夏侯渊督朱灵路招屯长安破刘雄鸣","accounts":[{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o014b-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"曹操还邺夏侯渊督朱灵路招屯长安破刘雄鸣","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"留军","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0278","role":"督军破敌","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0164","role":"屯军","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0023","role":"屯军","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q"]},{"person":"xiahoucao-p0018","role":"被破","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":212,"label":"建安十七年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xiahoucao-y212","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xiahoucao-q-o014","basis":"建安十七年"},"evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o014b-q","xiahoucao-q-o014","xiahoucao-q-b-5ddbebda291e48a385a3"]},"ordering_evidence":"xiahoucao-e-o014b-q","source_order":[9,60,"O014b"],"order":2142}],"persons":[{"id":"xiahoucao-p0018","name":"刘雄鸣","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o014","gongsuntao-q-ad69e9ee26a598236bf8","gongsuntao-q-5c889c56ed3697ce47f9","gongsuntao-q-d4aa3e64bf7f3a7a475f","gongsuntao-q-20ed8283e4640edbafc4"],"facts":[{"id":"gongsuntao-f-review-02909d4818f73e1f717f","text":"魏略记：蓝田人；少以采药射猎为事，常居覆车山下，以识道不迷，时人谓之能为云雾","evidence":["gongsuntao-q-20ed8283e4640edbafc4"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xiahoucao-m-o014-xiahoucao-p0018","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o014"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"gongsuntao-q-20ed8283e4640edbafc4","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-97eb311121e3002971a1","layer":"pei","quote":"刘雄鸣者，蓝田人也。少以采药射猎为事，常居覆车山下。每晨夜，出行云雾中。以识道不迷，而时人因谓之能为云雾","attribution":"魏略","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":313,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-866f31ffb4c5cf065e10","start":10,"end":62},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-5c889c56ed3697ce47f9","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-97eb311121e3002971a1","layer":"pei","quote":"后诣太祖。太祖执其手谓之曰：‘孤方入关，梦得一神人，即卿邪？’乃厚礼之，表拜为将军，遣令迎其部党。部党不欲降，遂劫以反，诸亡命皆往依之。有众数千人，据武关道口","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":313,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-866f31ffb4c5cf065e10","start":104,"end":183},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-ad69e9ee26a598236bf8","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-97eb311121e3002971a1","layer":"pei","quote":"郭、李之乱，人多就之。建安中，附属州郡；州郡表荐为小将。马超等反，不肯从，超破之","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":313,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-866f31ffb4c5cf065e10","start":63,"end":103},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-d4aa3e64bf7f3a7a475f","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-97eb311121e3002971a1","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖遣夏侯渊讨破之，雄鸣南奔汉中。汉中破，穷无所之，乃复归降。太祖捉其须曰：‘老贼，真得汝矣！’复其官，徙勃海","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":313,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-866f31ffb4c5cf065e10","start":184,"end":239},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o014b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-4de8ec3f953562853055","layer":"original","quote":"十七年〖1〗，太祖乃还邺，以渊行护军将军，督朱灵、路招等，屯长安。击破南山贼刘雄〔鸣〕，降其众。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":11,"end":59},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-b-5ddbebda291e48a385a3","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-5ddbebda291e48a385a3","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十七年：建安十七年（公元 212）。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":63,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-3ae2b4b8fe9aea30d935","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o014","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-4de8ec3f953562853055","layer":"original","quote":"与太祖会安定，降杨秋。十七年〖1〗，太祖乃还邺，以渊行护军将军，督朱灵、路招等，屯长安。击破南山贼刘雄〔鸣〕，降其众。围遂、超余党梁兴于鄠〖2〗，拔之，斩兴，封博昌亭侯。马超围凉州刺史韦康于冀〖3〗，渊救康；未到，康败。去冀二百余里，超来逆战。军不利。汧氐反，渊引军还。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":59,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":135}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
